Practical engineering checklist\nConfirm the cluster context, namespace, resource specification, responsible controller, scheduling result, node health, runtime state, network connectivity, storage, security configuration, and application readiness. Compare expected and observed conditions, collect diagnostic evidence, apply the smallest safe fix, and verify the final user-facing behavior. Record the cause and preventive action so the same incident can be diagnosed faster in the future."
